{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06446","headline":"二妃庙送裴侍御使桂阳 · 李颀","name":"二妃庙送裴侍御使桂阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沅上秋草晚，苍苍尧女祠。\n无人见精魄，万古寒猿悲。\n桂水身殁後，椒浆神降时。\n回云迎赤豹，骤雨飒文狸。\n受命出炎海，焚香徵楚词。\n乘骢感遗迹，一吊清川湄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}